`parse_bare_tool_calls` defaulting `allow_trunc_repair=true` at [src/api_common.h:607](/Users/macthedan/projects/q27/src/api_common.h:607) preserves behavior for existing 3-arg callers, including chat/Anthropic and streaming callers.

